    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52780" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλύν-ω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beautify</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέα πρόσωπα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					871.6
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.1.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθῳ Λακαίνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					18.223a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>gloss over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν ἐν κακοῖσί τις ἁλοὺς ἔπειτα
					τοῦτο καλλύνειν θέλῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					496
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδιάβολον κακὸν κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				944b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>pride oneself in</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				20c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>VH</u>
					3.19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sweep clean</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				936b27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				79.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ῥαίνηται καὶ
				καλλύνηται</span> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ
			πλατεῖα</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.33.4
			</span></i>.</div>
